<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Elevate U: Structured Skill & Career Growth</title>

<style>
    :root {
        /* Core palette */
        --bg: #172A38;
        --bg-deep: #10202C;
        --card: #243B49;

        /* Brown shades */
        --brown: #49352A;
        --brown-dark: #33231D;
        --brown-soft: #674C3B;
        --brown-light: #8B6A50;

        /* Cream shades */
        --cream: #F7F2E8;
        --cream-soft: #EEE3D1;
        --cream-muted: #D9CCB9;

        /* Accent colors */
        --accent: #D6B77A;
        --accent-soft: #E7D4AE;

        --text: #F7F2E8;
        --subtext: #D9D1C5;

        --border: rgba(247,242,232,0.13);
        --shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
    }

    * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    }

    html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
        background:
            linear-gradient(145deg, var(--bg-deep), var(--bg) 55%, #263B45);
        color: var(--text);
        padding: 40px 6%;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .page-container {
        max-width: 1250px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* Header */

    header {
        margin-bottom: 45px;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 55px 30px;
        background: linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            var(--brown-dark),
            var(--brown),
            #294354
        );
        border: 1px solid rgba(214,183,122,0.3);
        border-radius: 26px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .eyebrow {
        display: inline-block;
        color: var(--accent-soft);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 3px;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    header h1 {
        color: var(--cream);
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.3rem);
        line-height: 1.2;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    header p {
        color: var(--cream-muted);
        max-width: 720px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .header-divider {
        width: 75px;
        height: 4px;
        background: var(--accent);
        border-radius: 10px;
        margin: 25px auto 0;
    }

    /* Introduction */

    .intro-section {
        background: var(--cream);
        color: var(--brown-dark);
        padding: 30px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 35px;
        border-left: 6px solid var(--brown-soft);
    }

    .intro-section h2 {
        color: var(--brown);
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .intro-section p {
        color: #59483D;
        font-size: 0.98rem;
    }

    /* Section heading */

    .section-heading {
        margin: 45px 0 22px;
    }

    .section-heading h2 {
        color: var(--cream);
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .section-heading p {
        color: var(--subtext);
        max-width: 750px;
    }

    /* Cards */

    .grid-container {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
        gap: 24px;
        align-items: stretch;
    }

    .card {
        background: var(--card);
        padding: 30px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        transition: transform 0.25s ease, border-color 0.25s ease;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
    }

    .card::before {
        content: "";
        display: block;
        width: 45px;
        height: 4px;
        background: var(--accent);
        border-radius: 5px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
        border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .card h2 {
        color: var(--accent-soft);
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        font-size: 1.35rem;
        line-height: 1.35;
    }

    .card p {
        color: var(--subtext);
        font-size: 0.96rem;
    }

    /* Alternating cream cards */

    .card.cream-card {
        background: var(--cream);
        border-color: var(--cream-soft);
    }

    .card.cream-card h2 {
        color: var(--brown);
    }

    .card.cream-card p {
        color: #59483D;
    }

    .card.cream-card::before {
        background: var(--brown-light);
    }

    /* Brown feature cards */

    .card.brown-card {
        background: linear-gradient(
            145deg,
            var(--brown),
            var(--brown-dark)
        );
        border-color: rgba(214,183,122,0.25);
    }

    .card.brown-card h2 {
        color: var(--cream);
    }

    .card.brown-card p {
        color: var(--cream-muted);
    }

    /* Bottom message */

    .closing-section {
        margin-top: 50px;
        padding: 40px 30px;
        text-align: center;
        background: linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            var(--brown-dark),
            var(--brown-soft)
        );
        border: 1px solid rgba(214,183,122,0.3);
        border-radius: 22px;
    }

    .closing-section h2 {
        color: var(--cream);
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .closing-section p {
        color: var(--cream-muted);
        max-width: 750px;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    footer {
        text-align: center;
        padding: 30px 10px 10px;
        color: var(--cream-muted);
        font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    /* Responsive layout */

    @media (max-width: 650px) {
        body {
            padding: 20px 5%;
        }

        header {
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .grid-container {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .card {
            padding: 25px;
        }

        .section-heading h2 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }
    }
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="page-container">

    <header>
        <span class="eyebrow">Exclusive Tools, Resources & Next Steps </span>

        <h1>Elevate U: Structured Skill & Career Growth</h1>

        <p>
            Take your strategic discipline further. Access curated tools, advanced frameworks, and direct resources through Elevate to accelerate your personal and professional trajectory.
        </p>

        <div class="header-divider"></div>
    </header>

    <section class="intro-section">
        <h2>Growth Requires More Than Information</h2>

        <p>
            Learning becomes more valuable when knowledge is connected
            to deliberate practice, useful skills, real-world applications,
            and measurable progress. Use these principles to approach
            your education and career development as an organized system.
        </p>
    </section>

    <div class="section-heading">
        <h2>Core Principles for Structured Growth</h2>

        <p>
            Explore four areas that can influence how you learn,
            adapt, build professional value, and manage your development.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-container">

        <!-- Block 1: AI Synergy -->

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Mastering AI Synergy</h2>

            <p>
                AI is a force multiplier, not a replacement for human
                intellect. To master this, move beyond basic prompting.
                Use structured reasoning methods to break down research
                tasks, automate repetitive documentation, and leverage
                coding assistants to speed up technical learning.
                The goal is to act as an orchestrator who manages
                machine efficiency to perform higher-level cognitive work.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Block 2: Career Pivot Logic -->

        <div class="card cream-card">
            <h2>Career Pivot Logic</h2>

            <p>
                The economy rewards skill stacking over singular
                specialization. Combine three distinct fields to make
                yourself more adaptable and valuable. For example:
                financial literacy + data science + storytelling.
                While others focus on one job title, you can focus on
                the intersection of skills that allows you to solve
                problems that others cannot. Aim for a combination
                that is distinctive and applicable to emerging industries.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Block 3: Peak Performance Biology -->

        <div class="card brown-card">
            <h2>Peak Performance Biology</h2>

            <p>
                Your brain is a biological organ that operates within
                a physical system. Cognitive function is influenced by
                sleep quality, nutrition, stress, and movement.
                Prioritizing adequate sleep supports attention,
                learning, and memory. Treat mental energy as a resource
                that requires recovery, healthy routines, and deliberate
                management.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Block 4: Network Capital -->

        <div class="card">
            <h2>Network Capital</h2>

            <p>
                Your professional network can grow through the value
                you contribute. Rather than approaching every interaction
                by asking for favors, look for ways to contribute.
                Document your learning, build projects, share useful
                insights, and solve real-world problems. Demonstrating
                your abilities gives people a reason to recognize
                your work and build professional relationships with you.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>

    <section class="closing-section">
        <h2>Turn Knowledge Into Capability</h2>

        <p>
            Reading about a skill is only the beginning. Apply what you
            learn, create something that demonstrates your ability,
            evaluate your progress, and identify the next skill worth
            developing. Build a growth process that produces evidence
            of what you can actually do.
        </p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        Elevate U | Structured Skill & Career Growth
    </footer>

</div>

</body>
</html>
